    {
      "id": "claim_027b548a05d74f6f9e07ad909256ea08",
      "statement": "`talhelper genconfig` writes per-node machine configs named `<clusterName>-<hostname>.yaml` (e.g. `kubernetes-master0-nuc12.yaml`) plus a `talosconfig` client config into `talos/clusterconfig/`, and that directory's `.gitignore` excludes both generated artifacts from git.",
